# NOTICE

Sonata is built on the Infinitunes music player by Hemant Rajput.

- Infinitunes: https://github.com/rajput-hemant/infinitunes
- Copyright (c) 2023 Hemant Rajput
- License: MIT (see `LICENSE`)

The app shell, design system, player patterns, authentication scaffolding, database tooling, and
parts of the documentation are derived from Infinitunes. Sonata replaces the upstream catalog,
podcasts, radio, shows, mixes, and AI assistant with a subscription player where each master is a
1-of-1 NFT that owns a keyless NEAR account.

## Third-party software

This project uses open-source packages listed in `package.json`, `bun.lock`, and
`contracts/**/Cargo.toml`. Their licenses are governed by their respective projects. Run
`bun pm licenses` or inspect each package for details.

## Fonts and assets

- The heading and body fonts are loaded through the existing Infinitunes setup. Their licenses are
  governed by their font projects.
- Demo covers and audio committed under `apps/web/public/demo/` are original or CC0. Do not add
  copyrighted music to the repository.
- The Sonata wordmark and brand assets are original to this project.

## Testnet and mock assets

Sonata runs on NEAR testnet for the hackathon. The USDC contract is a mock NEP-141 token with no
real-world value and must never be deployed to mainnet. Nothing in this repository is financial
advice, a security, or an offer of real-world rights.
